# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root .dockerignore — the SINGLE ignore file Docker reads when the build
# context is the repo root (`context: .`), which is the case for ALL four image
# builds in .github/workflows/cd-k8s.yml.
#
# IMPORTANT: A `.dockerignore` placed next to a Dockerfile (e.g.
# infra/docker/backend/.dockerignore) is NOT read by Docker for a root-context
# build. Only BuildKit's `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` convention or this
# root file are honored. We therefore keep ONE correct root file here.
#
# This is a DENYLIST: everything is included by default; we list what to exclude.
# A denylist avoids the "re-include every parent directory" foot-gun that the
# `*` + whitelist idiom suffers from, and guarantees every Dockerfile's COPY
# instructions can find their sources.
#
# Each Dockerfile copies from a different tree, so this file must keep ALL of:
#   • APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/{src,prisma,scripts,package*,tsconfig*,nest-cli}
#   • APP3005/frontend/**            (Dockerfile copies the whole dir)
#   • APP3005_AI/Playground/vertexVT/** (body-analyzer)
#   • APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/{app,scripts,artifacts,*.toml,README,*.csv,reqs}
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Version control & editor/CI metadata ──────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github
.codex
.vscode
.idea

# ── Root-level docs (single-segment glob: only matches repo-root *.md) ─────────
*.md
Policies.pdf
docs/
deploy/

# ── Secrets / env — NEVER bake into an image ───────────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ── Dependencies & build outputs (all languages, all services) ────────────────
# NOTE: do NOT exclude **/*.sql — Prisma migrations are .sql and ARE needed.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/coverage/

# ── Python caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# ── Logs & DB dumps ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/backup.sql

# ── Compose files (not consumed by any image build) ───────────────────────────
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml

# ── Backend: heavy assets not needed inside the image ─────────────────────────
APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/test/
APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/assets/
APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/collection-data/
APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/test-collection/
APP3005/aivestire-backend-tmp/admin-cloth-upload/
APP3005/scripts/

# ── AI: large training datasets / archives (keep main_train_data.csv) ──────────
APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/training_main.csv
APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/training_main_test.csv
APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/training_main_train.csv
APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/*.zip
APP3005_AI/recommend_demo/etcd/
# ModelDemo & other Playground experiments are not part of any image build.
APP3005_AI/ModelDemo/
